// Transport helicopters drop their passengers off (crates/game_server/src/bots/vehicle.rs): on
// Dalian Plant (64) squads board the UH-60 and Z-8, the pilot lands by the objective, everyone
// else gets out (at their own objective, or "dropped off" at his) and the pilot flies back to
// base for more. The camera chases a transport helicopter on the way, at the landing and on
// the way back. Fails if a pilot takes off again with passengers still aboard ("dropped off
// his passengers": they never got out) or nobody flies a transport helicopter. Whether squads
// board at all varies from run to run: the report says how each drop-off went ("dropped off
// everyone" when the passengers got out).
// client --scenario scenarios/ai/heli_dropoff.ron --out target/scenarios/ai/heli_dropoff
(
    level: "dalian_plant",
    size: 64,
    bots: 32,
    spectate: true,
    steps: [
        WaitReady,
        ForbidLog("panicked"),
        ForbidLog("dropped off his passengers"),
        ExpectLog("(transport helicopter) seat 0 to Drive", 60.0),
        Wait(20.0),
        ChaseDriven("usthe_uh60", 25.0, 8.0),
        Screenshot("uh60_boarded"),
        Wait(10.0),
        ChaseDriven("chthe_z8", 25.0, 8.0),
        Screenshot("z8_flying"),
        Wait(8.0),
        ChaseDriven("chthe_z8", 22.0, 6.0),
        Screenshot("heli_approach"),
        // The drop-off: the pilot notes it as soon as the last passenger is out.
        Wait(60.0),
        ChaseDriven("usthe_uh60", 18.0, 5.0),
        Screenshot("heli_dropoff"),
        Wait(4.0),
        ChaseDriven("usthe_uh60", 25.0, 8.0),
        Screenshot("heli_leaving"),
        LogVehicles("after the drop-off"),
        Quit,
    ],
)
